              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/locally+convex+vector+space"} locally convex
              special case, see the article
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Fr%C3%A9chet+space"} Fréchet space
          %h1#section_table_of_contents Contents
