          %p
            In other words, an F-space is a vector space equipped with an F-norm whose induced metric is
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/complete+metric"} complete
            (or equivalently such that the topology on
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
